From 1460c32b8869b43e0b9bd97e58880d6a68d20ff4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:27:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): Tormach PathPilot mill post reads the operation's
 coolant

tormach.cps now declares coolantModes and reads PARAM Coolant. Off
writes no coolant word, so a dry router (Tormach 24R, no coolant list)
posts an Off operation. Mist, Air and Through tool take the machine's
own entry of that family, or are refused by name. Flood is unchanged.

Fixes #3446

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
