 crates/app/tests/coolant_air.rs            | 16 +++-
 crates/post/tests/tormach_coolant.rs       | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 docs/decisions/3446-tormach-coolant-off.md | 28 +++++++
 4 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/post/tests/tormach_coolant.rs
 create mode 100644 docs/decisions/3446-tormach-coolant-off.md

